{"seq":1,"slug":"next-page-prefetch","title":"下一页/sug 预取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-frontend-fullchain-performance/prefetch-cache/next-page-prefetch","wordCount":2198,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"下一页-sug-预取\">下一页/sug 预取</h1><p>预取是搜索性能里唯一一类&quot;用确定的小额浪费换确定的大额收益&quot;的手段。它不是让某个环节变快,而是把一次将来才会发生的等待提前到现在完成——如果猜对了,用户按下的那一刻结果已经就位,体感延迟接近零;如果猜错了,浪费的只是一次请求。判断预取值不值得做,取决于两个可测量的量:命中率与命中时的收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两类预取信号与它们的命中率上界\">核心概念:两类预取信号与它们的命中率上界</h2><p>搜索场景的预取信号分两类,它们的可预测性差别很大。</p>\n<p><strong>输入信号(sug 预取)</strong> 来自用户在搜索框里的输入。用户敲字的过程就是持续暴露意图的过程,但意图会变:输入&quot;手机&quot;时可能想搜&quot;手机壳&quot;,敲完&quot;手机壳&quot;之前的每一次预取都可能落空。因此 sug 预取的命中率上限由输入行为本身决定,不能做到很高。</p>\n<p><strong>结果信号(下一页预取)</strong> 来自用户已经看到的结果。用户滚到结果页底部时想翻下一页的概率远高于他在输入框里敲了三个字就想搜某个完整词的概率。这是预取里投入产出比最高的一类,也是应该优先实现的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预取类型</th>\n<th>触发信号</th>\n<th>命中率典型区间</th>\n<th>命中时收益</th>\n<th>单次浪费成本</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下一页预取</td>\n<td>滚动到结果列表 70%–80%</td>\n<td>高(翻页意图明确)</td>\n<td>省一个完整往返</td>\n<td>一次结果请求</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>悬停卡片预取</td>\n<td>指针在卡片上停留 &gt; 150ms</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>省详情请求往返</td>\n<td>一次详情请求</td>\n<td>高(桌面)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sug 预取(停顿触发)</td>\n<td>输入停顿 &gt; 200ms 且长度 ≥ 2</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>省一次联想往返</td>\n<td>一次轻量请求</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sug → 结果预热</td>\n<td>高置信度联想词</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>省一个往返</td>\n<td>一次结果请求</td>\n<td>低到中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回预取</td>\n<td>用户从详情页返回</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>省一个往返(缓存已有则免费)</td>\n<td>无(用缓存)</td>\n<td>高但应走缓存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>命中率的量级差异是选择顺序的直接依据:先做下一页与返回,再做悬停,最后考虑 sug 相关的预取。很多团队的反向顺序(sug 预取做得最复杂,下一页预取反而没做)是把精力投在了命中率最低的方向上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户输入 2 字符] --&gt; B{停顿超过 200ms?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| A&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[发起 sug 请求]&#10;    C --&gt; D{联想列表返回}&#10;    D --&gt; E{某条联想置信度高于阈值?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[预热该联想的结果数据]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[仅展示联想]&#10;    A --&gt; H[用户提交搜索]&#10;    H --&gt; I[展示结果页]&#10;    I --&gt; J{滚动到列表 75%?}&#10;    J --&gt;|否| I&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[发起下一页结果预取]&#10;    K --&gt; L{用户真的翻页?}&#10;    L --&gt;|是| M[命中: 立即渲染, 无等待]&#10;    L --&gt;|否| N[浪费: 一次请求 + 带宽]\">graph TD\n    A[用户输入 2 字符] --&gt; B{停顿超过 200ms?}\n    B --&gt;|否| A\n    B --&gt;|是| C[发起 sug 请求]\n    C --&gt; D{联想列表返回}\n    D --&gt; E{某条联想置信度高于阈值?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[预热该联想的结果数据]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[仅展示联想]\n    A --&gt; H[用户提交搜索]\n    H --&gt; I[展示结果页]\n    I --&gt; J{滚动到列表 75%?}\n    J --&gt;|否| I\n    J --&gt;|是| K[发起下一页结果预取]\n    K --&gt; L{用户真的翻页?}\n    L --&gt;|是| M[命中: 立即渲染, 无等待]\n    L --&gt;|否| N[浪费: 一次请求 + 带宽]</pre><h2 id=\"下一页预取的触发与取消\">下一页预取的触发与取消</h2><p>下一页预取看起来简单(滚到底部就请求),但有两个细节决定它是否有害。</p>\n<p><strong>触发时机要留足提前量。</strong> 如果等到用户滚到列表最底部才触发,预取的请求与用户真实翻页的请求几乎同时发出,预取没有省下任何时间。正确的触发点在第一页内容可见区域的四分之三处——用户在剩余四分之一里继续滚动的几百毫秒,就是预取请求的窗口。这个提前量需要按网络质量调整:弱网下需要更大的提前量(甚至在渲染第一页完成时就预取),强网下可以更靠后以避免不必要的请求。</p>\n<p><strong>必须支持取消。</strong> 用户滚动到 75% 但立即回滚到顶部的情况很常见,此时已发出的预取请求应该被取消以节省带宽与连接数。用 <code>AbortController</code> 处理;已经返回的预取结果可以保留在缓存里(它仍然有效),但不应触发任何 UI 更新——预取的消费者是缓存,不是渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function createNextPagePrefetcher({ query, threshold = 0.75 }) {&#10;  let controller = null;&#10;  let done = false;&#10;&#10;  return (scrollRatio) =&gt; {&#10;    if (done || scrollRatio &lt; threshold) return;&#10;    done = true;&#10;    controller = new AbortController();&#10;    const url = nextPageUrl(query);&#10;    fetch(url, { signal: controller.signal, priority: &#39;low&#39; })&#10;      .then((r) =&gt; r.json())&#10;      .then((data) =&gt; resultCache.set(url, data))&#10;      .catch(() =&gt; {});&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createNextPagePrefetcher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> controller </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scrollRatio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scrollRatio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    done </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    controller </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nextPageUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url, { signal: controller.signal, priority: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resultCache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url, data))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>priority: &#39;low&#39;</code>:预取请求绝不能与当前正在渲染所需的请求抢带宽。在弱网下,预取请求应该直接不发——这是降级策略的一部分,见 <a href=\"../e2e-latency-budget/slow-network-lowend\">弱网/低端机降级策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sug-预取的触发模型\">sug 预取的触发模型</h2><p>sug(搜索联想)预取的触发条件需要同时考虑三个变量:输入停顿、输入长度、以及输入行为(是否在删除)。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入状态</th>\n<th>意图确定性</th>\n<th>是否触发</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正在连续输入</td>\n<td>低,词在变</td>\n<td>不触发</td>\n<td>每击键一次请求,命中率低且浪费大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停顿 &gt; 200ms</td>\n<td>中,可能在想</td>\n<td>触发(长度 ≥ 2)</td>\n<td>停顿是&quot;停下来看&quot;的信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停顿 &gt; 500ms</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>触发并预热结果</td>\n<td>停顿时长与提交概率正相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长度 = 1</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不触发</td>\n<td>单字信息量太低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正在删除(退格)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>取消已发出的请求</td>\n<td>目标词已失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入后立即提交</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>直接用已返回的联想</td>\n<td>联想结果已在缓存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>长度阈值设为 2 而不是 1,是因为单字符的候选词太多,预取等于随机猜。停顿阈值设为 200 毫秒,是因为普通用户的击键间隔在 100 到 200 毫秒之间,低于这个阈值的&quot;停顿&quot;不是停顿,而是正常的输入节奏。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function createSuggestTrigger({ delay = 200, minLength = 2, onFire, onCancel }) {&#10;  let timer = null;&#10;  let controller = null;&#10;  let lastLength = 0;&#10;&#10;  return (value) =&gt; {&#10;    const len = value.trim().length;&#10;    const isDeleting = len &lt; lastLength;&#10;    lastLength = len;&#10;    clearTimeout(timer);&#10;    if (controller) {&#10;      controller.abort();&#10;      controller = null;&#10;      onCancel();&#10;    }&#10;    if (isDeleting || len &lt; minLength) return;&#10;    timer = setTimeout(() =&gt; {&#10;      controller = new AbortController();&#10;      onFire(value, controller.signal);&#10;    }, delay);&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSuggestTrigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">delay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">minLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">onFire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">onCancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> controller </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastLength </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isDeleting</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastLength;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lastLength </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    clearTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(timer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (controller) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      controller.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      controller </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      onCancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isDeleting </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minLength) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    timer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      controller </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      onFire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value, controller.signal);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }, delay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>联想结果与结果页数据之间还有一个可以复用的关联:用户点击某条联想后跳转的结果页,与服务端处理该查询词的结果是同一份。因此在服务端可以做&quot;查询词级的结果缓存&quot;,让联想点击后的结果请求直接命中——这不是前端预取技术,但它的效果与预取相同。服务端侧的缓存设计不在本 hub 范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预取的收益与浪费怎么算\">预取的收益与浪费怎么算</h2><p>预取是否值得做,可以用一个简单的期望收益公式判断。设命中率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>,命中时节省的时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 毫秒,单次预取的成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>(带宽与计算,以时间为等价单位),则每次预取的期望收益为:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = p \\cdot s - (1-p) \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取值代入后可以看到结论的形状:当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 400\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = 30\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> 也能得到正收益(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = 40 - 27 = 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>)。这说明预取的收益门槛很低——只要命中率不是极低,通常都值得做。也让&quot;先做命中率最高的那一类&quot;这个建议有了量化依据:在其他条件相同时,应先把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 最大的一类做出来。</p>\n<p>但公式有一个隐藏前提:<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 在弱网与省流模式下不是 30 毫秒,而是可能高达 300 毫秒以上(带宽稀缺,预取的流量会挤占真正需要的请求)。因此降级策略里关闭预取在弱网下是合理的——不是因为它命中率低,而是因为它的成本项暴涨。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>命中率 p</th>\n<th>节省 s</th>\n<th>成本 c</th>\n<th>期望收益</th>\n<th>是否开启</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强网 + 下一页预取</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>300ms</td>\n<td>30ms</td>\n<td>+120ms</td>\n<td>开启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强网 + sug 预取</td>\n<td>0.2</td>\n<td>300ms</td>\n<td>20ms</td>\n<td>+44ms</td>\n<td>开启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱网 + 下一页预取</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>600ms</td>\n<td>400ms</td>\n<td>+100ms</td>\n<td>谨慎(带宽挤占另算)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱网 + sug 预取</td>\n<td>0.2</td>\n<td>600ms</td>\n<td>300ms</td>\n<td>-120ms</td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>省流模式 + 任何预取</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>负</td>\n<td>强制关闭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>流量成本还要单独算一笔账:预取在移动端消耗的是用户的计费流量。如果一个搜索页日均 1000 万次访问,预取命中率 50%,每次预取传输 200KB,则每天浪费流量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext>KB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>TB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7 \\times 0.5 \\times 200\\text{KB} = 1\\text{TB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个量级足以让团队认真对待命中率,而不只是看体感指标。省流模式(<code>saveData</code>)下必须强制关闭预取。</p>\n<p>预取的收益验证必须用对比实验而不是直觉,因为它的收益会与其他优化混淆(缓存命中、网络抖动都会影响观测值)。归因方法见 <a href=\"perf-attribution-search\">搜索性能度量归因</a>,而预取的结果能否被复用取决于缓存设计,见 <a href=\"result-cache-client\">结果客户端缓存与返回命中</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预取信号分两类:输入信号(sug 预取)与结果信号(下一页预取);结果信号的命中率显著更高,应优先实现。</li>\n<li>优先顺序按命中率:下一页 &gt; 返回 &gt; 悬停卡片 &gt; sug 停顿触发 &gt; sug 结果预热。</li>\n<li>下一页预取的触发点应在可见区域的 75% 附近以留出提前量,并必须支持 <code>AbortController</code> 取消。</li>\n<li>sug 预取的判定三变量:停顿 &gt; 200ms、长度 ≥ 2、非删除状态;删除时必须取消已发出的请求。</li>\n<li>期望收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = p \\cdot s - (1-p) \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>:门槛很低,但只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 因弱网暴涨,期望就可能转负。</li>\n<li>预取请求必须标为低优先级,并在弱网与省流模式下强制关闭;流量成本需按访问量单独估算。</li>\n<li>预取的收益验证必须用 A/B 对比,因为它与缓存命中、网络抖动容易混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"下一页/sug 预取","id":"下一页-sug-预取"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念:两类预取信号与它们的命中率上界","id":"核心概念-两类预取信号与它们的命中率上界"},{"level":2,"text":"下一页预取的触发与取消","id":"下一页预取的触发与取消"},{"level":2,"text":"sug 预取的触发模型","id":"sug-预取的触发模型"},{"level":2,"text":"预取的收益与浪费怎么算","id":"预取的收益与浪费怎么算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"弱网/低端机降级策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-frontend-fullchain-performance/e2e-latency-budget/slow-network-lowend"},"next":{"title":"结果客户端缓存与返回命中","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-frontend-fullchain-performance/prefetch-cache/result-cache-client"}}